00:16:21.000 --> 00:17:10.000
sure that it's not just a kid who doesn't like math, but this is really an anxious child? Yeah, absolutely. So you mentioned my scale at the beginning of the podcast. It's called the Children's Anxiety and Math Scale. You can email me and I will gladly share a copy with anyone, K through 12, educator, researchers, anyone who's interested in the scale, it's very easy to administer and it's very easy to score. And it kind of just gives you an overall idea if the student is likely to have math anxiety based on how they're answering questions, right? The other thing, if you don't have the time or ability to do a direct measure like that, another thing I would recommend to K-12 teachers is to work with and talk to your school psychologist.

23
00:17:10.000 --> 00:18:27.000
